abstract: >-
  Axiom is an enterprise military-grade SOC intelligence platform designed to detect,
  classify, and attribute Coordinated Inauthentic Behavior (CIB), automated bots,
  and state/commercial astroturfing buzzers across multi-platform social media (X/Twitter,
  Instagram, and YouTube). The platform is powered by the Axiom-Core research engine,
  featuring a 21-feature behavioral profiling pipeline, Shannon temporal entropy metrics,
  24/7 circadian Chi-Square goodness-of-fit testing, vector semantic narrative clustering,
  XGBoost tri-class classification, and adversarial LLM prompt injection defense.
